      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Root the Stance</h1><p><em>Thorns lace the knight’s boots to the soil.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-briar-knight-root-the-stance</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 2 while on soil until its next turn; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
